-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §134 שעות גיל: the existing arrangement of
-- age hours for kindergarten teachers goes on (its normative standing
-- unchanged).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `134 שעות גיל`

@ref akn:art_134
ASSUME `the existing age-hours arrangement for kindergarten teachers` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO NUMBER

GIVEN age IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a kindergarten teacher's age hours` age IS
    `the existing age-hours arrangement for kindergarten teachers` age
